 # Forager inventory
 
 Shared inventory, stacking and crafting modules for the Forager Roblox experience.
+
+## Layout
+
+`src/shared` is synced to `ReplicatedStorage.Shared` by Rojo (`default.project.json`):
+
+- `Items.luau`: item catalogue and stack limits
+- `Signal.luau`: minimal Roblox-style signal
+- `Inventory.luau`: slots, stacking, moving, change events and saves
+- `Crafting.luau`: recipes and atomic crafting
+
+## Tests
+
+The modules are plain Luau and run outside Studio with [Lune](https://lune-org.github.io/docs):
+
+```sh
+lune run tests/run.luau
+```
